*begin Swinsto

; SWINSTO SURVEY
; 24-25 June 2000
; by members of Durham Univ. SA and Reading Univ. CC
;
; Calibration was performed after finishing surveying on 25 June
; Since the Reading team were pressed for time, we all calibrated
; at two gateposts at Mrs Morphet's caravan park, Ingleton, and then
; Julia and Anthony calibrated all the instruments at BPF
;
; At caravan park:
; Person	Inst Set	Comp	Clino
; Lisa		5		316	+7; -7.5
; Tom		5		316.5	+7.5; -8
; Lisa		4		319	+8; -7.5
; John		2		318	+8; -8
; Julia		3		319	+8; -8
; Anthony	4		317.5	+8; -7.5
; Anthony	2		317	+8; -8
;
; At BPF, sighting from wall corner outside front door to
; RH edge of LH gatepost:
;
; Inst set	Julia			Anthony
; 1		349.5	+4.50		350.5	+5.50
; 2		349	+4.00		350.5	+5.50
; 3		349	+4.00		350	+5.00
; 4		348	+3.00		350	+5.00
; 5		348	+3.00		349.5	+4.50
;
; All instruments provided by CUCC, all standard lensed Suuntos
;
; Serial numbers:
;
; Inst set	Comp.	Clino
; 1		112518	232011
; 2		132004	838638
; 3		512183	348123
; 4		741127	145132
; 5		721899	726974

*equate Swi01.65 Swi02.27
*equate Swi02.1 Swi03.1
*equate Swi03.31 Swi04.1

*fix Swi01.1 69390.00 77530.00 378.00 ;GPS

